---

## Status vocabulary

| Status    | Meaning                              | Required fields                     |
| --------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| `Missing` | No verification — tracked by issue   | `issue_ref` in `#NNN` format        |
| `Partial` | Code exists; test incomplete         | `code_ref` non-empty                |
| `Done`    | Requirement verified by a test       | `code_ref` + `test_ref` non-empty   |

Promotion is fail-closed (cannot skip a step).

